// Title: Suspicious System-Named DLL Staged in User OneDrive Directory
//
// Description:
// Detects creation of DLLs with Windows system-library names directly under the
// per-user Microsoft OneDrive installation tree. C2Looper was observed downloading
// wtsapi32.dll into %LocalAppData%\Microsoft\OneDrive\ and then abusing a legitimate
// OneDrive executable to side-load the malicious DLL.
//
// MITRE ATT&CK:
// - T1574.002 Hijack Execution Flow: DLL Side-Loading
// - T1036 Masquerading (supporting context)
//
// False Positive Notes:
// Legitimate OneDrive updates may create DLLs under the OneDrive installation tree.
// However, common Windows system-library names directly under the user OneDrive path
// were not observed in the 30-day baseline used for validation.
// Investigate before adding exclusions.
//
// Investigation Guidance:
// - Review the initiating process and full process ancestry.
// - Check whether the DLL was created shortly before OneDrive.exe or another OneDrive
//   binary executed from the same directory.
// - Verify file signature, signer, prevalence, and hash reputation.
// - Review nearby OneDrive termination/restart activity.
// - Hunt for subsequent process creation, payload staging, or outbound C2 traffic.
// - Check for C2Looper-related reconnaissance commands and GitHub JSON C2 artifacts.
//
// Initiating Article:
// Zscaler ThreatLabz - C2Looper: New Backdoor Likely Tied to Ransomware, GitHub C2
// https://www.zscaler.com/blogs/security-research/c2looper-new-backdoor-likely-tied-ransomware-github-c2

let Lookback = 30d;
let SuspiciousSystemDllNames = dynamic([
    "wtsapi32.dll",
    "version.dll",
    "winhttp.dll",
    "wininet.dll",
    "cryptbase.dll",
    "dbghelp.dll",
    "profapi.dll",
    "secur32.dll",
    "netutils.dll"
]);
DeviceFileEvents
| where Timestamp >= ago(Lookback)
| where FileName in~ (SuspiciousSystemDllNames)
| where FolderPath has @"\AppData\Local\Microsoft\OneDrive\"
| project
    Timestamp,
    ActionType,
    FileName,
    FolderPath,
    SHA256,
    InitiatingProcessFileName,
    InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
    InitiatingProcessFolderPath,
    InitiatingProcessAccountName,
    InitiatingProcessParentFileName,
    InitiatingProcessSHA256
| order by Timestamp desc
